    "This course discusses the mathematical descriptions of heat generation and distribution in the reactor core, and heat removal by coolant flow. Furthermore, the numerical methods are discussed to solve the equations which describe the heat transfer in the reactor core.  The critical thermal factor and the related theory for reactor thermal design, and boiling and two-phase flow phenomena are also included.": 1,
